    "title": "HPU dedicates Center for Student Success in memory of student Bo Rozell - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Derrick Stuckly ,\n1 days ago Howard Payne University (HPU) dedicated its Center for Student Success in memory of Bo Rozell during a special ceremony on Oct. 13. Rozell, a former student remembered for his unwavering faith in Christ, joyful spirit and kindness toward others, passed away in January 2026 at the age of 21. The center was created through the generosity of Rozell’s grandmother, Dr. Diann Huber, and will continue to serve students in his memory. Read full article",
